/thumb/4/46/Portrait_Tusgront.png/50px-Portrait_Tusgront.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tusgront\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/46/Portrait_Tusgront.png/25px-Portrait_Tusgront.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/46/Portrait_Tusgront.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tusgront\" title=\"Tusgront\">Tusgront</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;58&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-102</span></li>\n<li>In a locked wooden chest (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;15 Sleight of Hand Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;15 <a href=\"/wiki/Sleight_of_Hand\" title=\"Sleight of Hand\">Sleight of Hand</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a>) in the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;58&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-102</span></li>\n<li>In the basement of the same house, in a trapped chest (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;15 Sleight of Hand Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;15 <a href=\"/wiki/Sleight_of_Hand\" title=\"Sleight of Hand\">Sleight of Hand</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a>) hidden behind a pressure-plate activated false wall at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-2325&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;1056</span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This ring can be inserted into the wall slot at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;59&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-97</span> to reveal the entrance to the <a href=\"/wiki/Guildhall\" title=\"Guildhall\">Guildhall</a>. Using it this way will transform it into the uncommon variant of this item.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<p><br>\n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-hrule nomobile\" style=\"user-select: none;\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span><picture><img src=\"/w/images/b/be/Bg3_content_hr.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"460\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/be/Bg3_content_hr.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div>\n<p><br>\n \n</p>\n<h1><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variant\">Variant</span></h1>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-uncommon\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Guild_Ring_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Guild_Ring_Faded.png/300px-Guild_Ring_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/3/3e/Guild_Ring_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Guild Ring image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Gui